Description:

Two new event parameters report the special-use attributes of the mailbox
an event refers to: vnd.fastmail.specialUse on message, flags, and mailbox
events, and vnd.fastmail.oldSpecialUse for the source mailbox of
MessageCopy, MessageMove and MailboxRename.  Both are omitted when the
mailbox has no special-use attribute.


Documentation:

imapd.conf(5), event_extra_params.


Config changes:

event_extra_params accepts the new value vnd.fastmail.specialUse, which
enables both parameters.


Upgrade instructions:

None.  The parameters are opt-in: add vnd.fastmail.specialUse to
event_extra_params to receive them.


GitHub issue:

None.
